"type": "name", "content": "bank "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the higher ground that is along the edge of a river or stream "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It was nice sitting on the bank of the river."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob04aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "palace"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the official home of a king, queen, or president, etc. "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The palace was home to many kings and queens."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob04aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cannon"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a large gun that shoots heavy metal or stone balls  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There was a famous cannon outside the palace gates."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob04aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "armory "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a supply of weapons "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The armory is located near the cathedral."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob04aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "uninterrupted "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to be able to see clearly without anything in the way. "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I had an uninterrupted view of the Kremlin."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob04aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "coronation "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a ceremony in which a crown is placed on the head of a new king or queen "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The coronation of the Queen was very special."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob04aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "procession "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an organized group or line of people or vehicles that move together slowly as part of a ceremony "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The procession traveled down the road towards the cemetery."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob04aud09"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to mourn "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to feel or show great sadness because someone has died "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The citizens were mourning their Tsar."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob04aud10"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Research a site or attraction in your town or city."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a tour ad. (50 to 75 words)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Describe the location."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Give times for events."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your tour ad to a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research a site or attraction."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a tour ad."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I describe a location."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my tour ad to a partner."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 2, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le02ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le02ob04re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le02ob04re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Book a spot on 